1
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:02,950
Please don't call anyone.

2
00:00:04,233 --> 00:00:05,313
Hiii!

3
00:00:05,649 --> 00:00:07,119
She's called my boss.

4
00:00:07,589 --> 00:00:08,419
Twice.

5
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:11,150
So now, I open TinyTouch first.

6
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:14,100
Every tap is a bubble, an animal, a note.

7
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Swipes and the crown are part of the game. Nothing gets out.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,950
From my phone, I switch the game, or start the lullaby.

9
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:24,750
Getting out takes a three-second hold. Little fingers can't.

10
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:26,386
Zero calls.

11
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:30,000
TinyTouch. Gentle play. No surprise calls.
